      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## Smart Appointment Organizer + Telegram Reminders\n### How it works\n\nThe workflow acts as an AI-powered appointment booking assistant via Telegram.\nIt extracts requested appointment details from incoming messages using an AI agent.\nIf information is missing, it asks the user for clarification before proceeding.\nComplete appointments are scheduled in Google Calendar, saved to Google Sheets, and confirmed with the user.\nA secondary scheduled process periodically checks for upcoming appointments to send timely Telegram reminders.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Configure Telegram credentials in the Trigger and all Telegram action nodes.\n- [ ] Connect Google Calendar and Google Sheets credentials to the respective nodes.\n- [ ] Add Google Gemini AI credentials in the AI Agent node for message parsing.\n- [ ] Ensure the Google Sheet has columns for appointment details and reminder statuses.\n- [ ] Adjust the schedule trigger interval to match your desired reminder frequency.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can adjust the schedule trigger frequency and customize the system prompt in the AI Agent to change how the bot interacts with users."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
